sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Contact import and receipt recovery
  accDescr: The wizard maps and validates a CSV. The import records a receipt and saved skipped or invalid outcomes. A lost response is reconciled with the same file and mapping.
  actor U as Workspace member
  participant W as Import wizard
  participant I as Scoped import service
  U->>W: Select CSV and review mapping
  W->>W: Validate supported fields
  W->>I: Submit file and mapping identity
  I->>I: Record import receipt and row outcomes
  alt Response received
    I-->>W: Saved, skipped and invalid counts
  else Response lost
    W->>I: Reconcile import status
    U->>W: Reselect identical file if requested
    W->>I: Recover same operation and mapping
    I-->>W: Existing recorded result
  end
